{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28378","headline":"忆齐安郡 · 杜牧","name":"忆齐安郡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生睡足处，云梦泽南州。\n一夜风欺竹，连江雨送秋。\n格卑常汩汩，力学强悠悠。\n终掉尘中手，潇湘钓漫流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}